---
import '@fontsource/inter/300.css';
import '@fontsource/inter/400.css';
import '../styles/global.css';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Libre+Baskerville:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
		<title>services — senja studio</title>
		<style>
			.nav-link { position: relative; }
			.nav-link:hover { color: #c2c2c2; }
			.nav-link.active { color: #1c1c1c; }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="fixed top-3 left-6 right-6 z-10 flex flex-row items-start">
			<a href="/" class="block text-[41px] leading-tight font-normal" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #1c1c1c; text-transform: uppercase;">senja studio</a>
		</div>
		<nav class="fixed right-6 z-10 flex flex-row text-[0.76rem] font-[325]" style="top: 17px; font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #1c1c1c;">
			<a href="/" class="nav-link">projects</a><span>,&nbsp;</span><a href="/services" class="nav-link active">services</a><span>,&nbsp;</span><a href="/about" class="nav-link">about</a><span>,&nbsp;</span><a href="/contact" class="nav-link">contact</a>
		</nav>

		<a href="/" class="absolute top-4 right-6 z-10 text-lg leading-tight font-normal text-[#1c1c1c] transition-colors hover:text-neutral-300" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">✕</a>


		<main class="min-h-screen px-6 pb-24 pt-28">
			<div class="ml-[29vw] max-w-xl">
				<h1 class="relative block text-[25.33px] leading-tight font-normal" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #1c1c1c;">services</h1>
				<div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-justify text-sm font-[325] leading-relaxed" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: #1c1c1c;">
					<p>SENJA STUDIO works across creative direction, brand consulting and visual content production for hospitality and lifestyle brands.</p>
					<p>Projects can be developed from the ground up or tailored to a specific need, from a complete visual direction to a small collection of images and short form videos.</p>

					<div class="space-y-0.5 pt-6">
						<p class="text-sm font-medium" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">PRE PRODUCTION</p>
						<p>Concept<br />Moodboard<br />Storyboard<br />Shot List<br />Creative Direction<br />Content Strategy<br />Brand Image Audit<br />Visual Identity Consultation</p>
						<p class="pt-2">From a simple shoot concept to a full creative direction, we define what needs to be created and how.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-0.5 pt-6">
						<p class="text-sm font-medium" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">PRODUCTION</p>
						<p>Photography<br />Film<br />UGC<br />On Location Shooting<br />Art Direction</p>
						<p class="pt-2">Production can be as focused or as extensive as the project requires, from a few social assets to a full campaign.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-0.5 pt-6">
						<p class="text-sm font-medium" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">POST PRODUCTION</p>
						<p>Editing<br />Color Grading<br />Sound Design<br />Retouching</p>
						<p class="pt-2">We handle the final image and film across digital, social and editorial formats.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-0.5 pt-6">
						<p class="text-sm font-medium" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">DELIVERABLES</p>
						<p>Reels<br />Stories<br />Feed<br />TikTok<br />Paid Ads<br />Website Imagery<br />Editorial<br />Lookbook<br />Campaign</p>
						<p class="pt-2">Content is delivered in the formats each project needs, from a handful of social assets to a complete visual library. All content delivered promptly with full usage rights included. Ready to post.</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-0.5 pt-6">
						<p class="text-sm font-medium" style="font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">BRAND CONSULTING</p>
						<p>Visual Identity Audit<br />Content Strategy<br />Social Media Direction</p>
						<p class="pt-2">For brands looking for more than production, we offer focused creative and brand consulting to help clarify their visual identity and content direction.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>

		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
